          "fill": "$label.primary",
          "content": "11 Collaboration and Accessibility Bench",
          "fontFamily": "$font.sftext",
          "fontSize": 26,
          "fontWeight": "semibold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pEU0Y",
          "name": "Bench Promise",
          "fill": "$label.secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Curiosity drives every canvas. Humans collaborate across everything: presence, shared cursors, and comments follow the project, not one surface. Every surface is super accessible by default — VoiceOver reading order, Dynamic Type to AX5, Full Keyboard Access, Switch Control, Assistive Access, and explicit fallbacks for Reduce Transparency, Increase Contrast, and Reduce Motion.",
          "lineHeight": 1.32,
          "fontFamily": "$font.sftext",
          "fontSize": 17,
          "fontWeight": "regular"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "OALA7",
          "name": "Contract Cards Row",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 210,
          "gap": 20,
          "alignItems": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "q97O8q",
              "name": "Bench Collaboration Contract",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$background.secondary",
              "cornerRadius": 16,
              "stroke": "$separator",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "GkBY7",
                  "name": "Bench Collaboration Contract Label",
                  "fill": "$label.primary",
                  "content": "Bench Collaboration Contract",
                  "fontFamily": "$font.sftext",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "semibold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XWJRm",
                  "name": "Bench Collaboration Contract Body",
                  "fill": "$label.secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A project-level invite shares every surface. People who join land in the same project and see live presence, shared cursors, and comments. Presence never blocks editing, shared cursors stay inside their surface, and undo stays local until the system reconciles it.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.35,
                  "fontFamily": "$font.sftext",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "regular"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ocSoE",
              "name": "Bench Accessibility Contract",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$background.secondary",
              "cornerRadius": 16,
              "stroke": "$separator",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 10,
              "padding": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "GCVzu",
                  "name": "Bench Accessibility Contract Label",
                  "fill": "$label.primary",
                  "content": "Bench Accessibility Contract",
                  "fontFamily": "$font.sftext",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "semibold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fyVuT",
                  "name": "Bench Accessibility Contract Body",
                  "fill": "$label.secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Section 11 is normative. VoiceOver order, AX5 text growth, focus rings, switch scanning, and Assistive Access are required fallback states, not extras. Native controls own rendering on device; these specimens define the contract every surface must satisfy.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.35,
                  "fontFamily": "$font.sftext",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "regular"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "NjC8V",
          "name": "Accessibility Specimen Grid",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fill_container",
          "gap": 20,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "O0K6Hb",
              "name": "Specimen Column A",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "height": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "vRK1c",
                  "name": "Card / VoiceOver reading order",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "height": 140,
                  "fill": "$background.secondary",
                  "cornerRadius": 16,
                  "stroke": "$separator",
                  "strokeWidth": 1,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "padding": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "z9VmK",
                      "name": "Card / VoiceOver reading order Label",
                      "fill": "$label.primary",
                      "content": "VoiceOver reading order",
                      "fontFamily": "$font.sftext",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "semibold"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "a15Rt",
                      "name": "Card / VoiceOver reading order Detail",
                      "fill": "$label.secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Reading order follows visual order: project menu, peer tabs, toolbar actions, surface content, then inspector. Rows are one combined element; selection announces as a selected button; live changes announce without interrupting.",
